---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Quant workbench" eyebrow="Tools / Manual inputs">
  <div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Calculator"><button role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="bond-panel" id="bond-tab" data-tab="bond">Bonds</button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="sizing-panel" id="sizing-tab" data-tab="sizing" tabindex="-1">Position sizing</button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="vol-panel" id="vol-tab" data-tab="vol" tabindex="-1">Portfolio volatility</button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="fx-panel" id="fx-tab" data-tab="fx" tabindex="-1">FX forward</button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="scenario-panel" id="scenario-tab" data-tab="scenario" tabindex="-1">Scenario lab</button></div>
  <section id="bond-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="bond-tab" class="lab-panel"><h2>Fixed-coupon bond</h2><p class="method-note">Cash flows on coupon dates. Flat nominal yield compounded at coupon frequency; no accrued interest, default or embedded options.</p><form id="bond-form" class="form-grid calculator-inputs"><label>Face value<input type="number" name="face" value="100" min="0.01" step="any" required /></label><label>Coupon (%)<input type="number" name="coupon" value="3" min="0" step="any" required /></label><label>Yield (%)<input type="number" name="yield" value="4" step="any" required /></label><label>Maturity (years)<input type="number" name="years" value="5" min="0.25" max="100" step="0.25" required /></label><label>Coupons / year<select name="frequency"><option value="1">Annual</option><option value="2">Semiannual</option><option value="4">Quarterly</option></select></label><label>Yield shock (bp)<input type="number" name="shock" value="50" step="any" required /></label><button type="submit" class="button"><i data-lucide="equal"></i>Calculate</button></form><div id="bond-result" class="calculation-result" aria-live="polite"></div></section>
  <section id="sizing-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="sizing-tab" class="lab-panel" hidden><h2>Scenario-based position sizing</h2><form id="sizing-form" class="form-grid calculator-inputs"><label>NAV (CAD)<input type="number" name="nav" value="100000000" min="1" step="any" required /></label><label>Loss budget (% of NAV)<input type="number" name="risk" value="0.5" min="0" step="any" required /></label><label>Adverse price move (%)<input type="number" name="adverse" value="5" min="0.001" step="any" required /></label><button type="submit" class="button"><i data-lucide="equal"></i>Calculate</button></form><div id="sizing-result" class="calculation-result" aria-live="polite"></div></section>
  <section id="vol-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="vol-tab" class="lab-panel" hidden><h2>Two-asset portfolio volatility</h2><p class="method-note">Annualized inputs. Signed weights allow leverage and shorts; unallocated weight is zero-volatility cash. Fixed correlations and linear exposures.</p><form id="vol-form" class="form-grid calculator-inputs"><label>Asset A weight (%)<input type="number" name="w1" value="60" step="any" required /></label><label>Asset B weight (%)<input type="number" name="w2" value="40" step="any" required /></label><label>Asset A volatility (%)<input type="number" name="v1" value="10" min="0" step="any" required /></label><label>Asset B volatility (%)<input type="number" name="v2" value="15" min="0" step="any" required /></label><label>Correlation<input type="number" name="rho" value="0.2" min="-1" max="1" step="0.01" required /></label><button type="submit" class="button"><i data-lucide="equal"></i>Calculate</button></form><div id="vol-result" class="calculation-result" aria-live="polite"></div></section>
  <section id="fx-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="fx-tab" class="lab-panel" hidden><h2>Covered interest parity</h2><p class="method-note">Spot and forward quoted as domestic currency per one foreign unit (e.g. CAD per USD). Simple annual interest, no basis or transaction costs. Forward premium is not a forecast of spot returns.</p><form id="fx-form" class="form-grid calculator-inputs"><label>Spot<input type="number" name="spot" value="1.35" min="0.000001" step="any" required /></label><label>Domestic rate (%)<input type="number" name="domestic" value="3" step="any" required /></label><label>Foreign rate (%)<input type="number" name="foreign" value="4" step="any" required /></label><label>Tenor (years)<input type="number" name="years" value="1" min="0.001" step="any" required /></label><button type="submit" class="button"><i data-lucide="equal"></i>Calculate</button></form><div id="fx-result" class="calculation-result" aria-live="polite"></div></section>
  <section id="scenario-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="scenario-tab" class="lab-panel" hidden><h2>Portfolio stress scenario</h2><p class="method-note">Linear approximation: sum of shock &times; signed CAD P&amp;L sensitivity. For long duration, yield sensitivity is negative DV01. Percentage shocks use percentage points: enter -10 for a 10% fall. No convexity, correlation changes, or liquidity effects.</p><form id="scenario-form" class="stack"><div class="table-scroll"><table class="scenario-table"><thead><tr><th>Factor</th><th>Shock</th><th>Signed sensitivity</th></tr></thead><tbody>{[['yield', 'Yield', 'bp', '-10000'], ['fx', 'FX', '%', '50000'], ['equity', 'Equity', '%', '100000'], ['commodity', 'Commodity', '%', '25000']].map(([id, label, unit, sensitivity]) => <tr><th>{label}</th><td><label>{unit}<input type="number" name={`${id}-shock`} value={id === 'yield' ? '50' : '-5'} step="any" required /></label></td><td><label>CAD / {unit === 'bp' ? 'bp' : '1% move'}<input type="number" name={`${id}-sensitivity`} value={sensitivity} step="any" required /></label></td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div><button type="submit" class="button"><i data-lucide="equal"></i>Run scenario</button></form><div id="scenario-result" class="calculation-result" aria-live="polite"></div></section>
</Layout>
